{
  "study": "Solve-scoped profiling of the daily search and the CR07 treatment (L), 2026-10-14",
  "method": {
    "harness": "scheduler-service SolverBenchmark with -Dbenchmark.jfr: one jdk.jfr.Recording (profile settings) per measured solve, covering the solve alone",
    "jvm": "java -Xmx1536m -XX:ActiveProcessorCount=2 -XX:+UseSerialGC (the experiment runtime's daily flags), JDK 25, Timefold 2.6.0",
    "profiledCases": "TABU_KOPT, 20 and 50 technicians, CLUSTERED and DISPERSED, fixture seed 7001 (disjoint from the tuning fixture seed 0), seed 17, 10 s budget (6.7 s cost phase, 3.3 s fairness phase)",
    "pairedStudy": "TABU_KOPT, 20 and 50 technicians, CLUSTERED, DISPERSED, ABSENCE, TIGHT_WINDOW, seeds 17, 23, 41, fixture seed 7001, 10 s budget; before = engine jar built from 7ca5c72, after = the treated engine; same harness classes, run one after the other on an otherwise idle workstation (AMD Ryzen 9 7900X)",
    "exactness": "scheduler-service ScoringExactnessTest: step-limited CURRENT_CAPPED solves with a fixed seed on three fixtures produce the same score, move count, arrangement and independent evaluation before and after",
    "treatment": "CR07: RoadMatrix indexes legs by endpoint number with buffered minutes computed once per fact revision (built lazily on the first scoring lookup); RouteTimeline and RouteTimingSearch evaluate against PlanFacts (no DayPlan per scored route) and skip arrival maps on the score-only path",
    "notImplemented": "TF13 (invariant technician context) and TF12 (incremental collectors): the profile did not name them. moveThreadCount: multithreaded solving is a Timefold Enterprise feature (https://docs.timefold.ai/timefold-solver/latest/commercial-editions/commercial-editions, retrieved 2026-10-14) and CampaignSolverConfiguration refuses it; not available to this Community build."
  },
